@startuml classes-dominio-enriquecimento
!include ../../../docs/diagramas/tema-plataforma.iuml

hide empty members
hide stereotype
skinparam nodesep 30
title $I_VEICULO Pacote com.mmda.serverless.provider.domain.enrichment — reuso e liderança

class EnrichmentRequest <<valor>> {
    eventId, workRef, organizationId, quoteId
    version : int
    provider, operation, contractVersion
    {field} params : Params(vehicleRef, principalDriverRef)
    deadlineAt : Instant
}
class EnrichmentReply <<valor>> {
    clientReference, vehicle, driver
    observedAt, code
    notFoundRefs : List<String>
}
class EnrichmentProfile <<valor>> {
    {field} vehicle : Vehicle(ref, make, model, year, marketValue)
    {field} principalDriver : Driver(ref, licenseYears, claimsLast5Years)
}
class EnrichmentProtocol <<serviço>> {
    {static} classify(CallOutcome<EnrichmentReply>) : EnrichmentVerdict
}
interface EnrichmentVerdict <<valor>> <<sealed>>
class Found <<valor>> {
    profile : EnrichmentProfile
}
class NotFound <<valor>> {
    notFoundRefs : List<String>
}
class "Transient" as VTransient <<valor>> {
    errorClass
}
class Failed <<valor>> {
    errorClass
}
class "Unknown" as VUnknown <<valor>> {
    errorClass
}
enum EnrichmentResultType {
    FOUND
    NOT_FOUND
    FAILED
    isReusable() : boolean
}
enum ReuseDecision {
    HIT
    JOIN
    MISS
}
class ReuseIndexEntry <<agregado>> {
    queryId, evidenceId
    resultType : EnrichmentResultType
    reusableUntil : Instant
    revision : long
    policyVersion
    servesAt(agora, policyVersion) : boolean
}
class Leadership <<agregado>> {
    {field} state : State (IN_FLIGHT, COMPLETED)
    fencingVersion, firstFencingVersion : long
    leaderWorkRef, queryId
    leaseUntil : Instant
    evidenceId, resultType
    isTransferableAt(agora) : boolean
    firstFencingVersionOfSuccessor() : long
    chainIncludes(versão) : boolean
    answers(versãoDoSeguidor) : boolean
    isLedBy(workRef) : boolean
}
interface ReusePlan <<serviço>> <<sealed>> {
    {static} of(reuse, leadership, workRef, agora, policyVersion) : ReusePlan
}
class Hit <<valor>> {
    entry : ReuseIndexEntry
}
class Join <<valor>> {
    fencingVersion : long
}
class Lead <<valor>> {
    fencingVersion, firstFencingVersion : long
    expectedFencingVersion : Long
    expectedReuseRevision : Long
}
class OwnLeadership <<valor>>
class EnrichmentResolved <<evento>> {
    {field} eventId = UUIDv5(queryId|workRef)
    occurredAt, schemaVersion = "1"
    workRef, quoteId, version, queryId, evidenceId
    reuseDecision : ReuseDecision
    policyVersion
    resultType : EnrichmentResultType
    result : EnrichmentProfile
    notFoundRefs, reusableUntil, errorClass
}

EnrichmentRequest ..> EnrichmentProtocol : pedido ao provedor
EnrichmentProtocol ..> EnrichmentReply : lê
EnrichmentProtocol ..> EnrichmentVerdict : devolve
EnrichmentVerdict <|.. Found
EnrichmentVerdict <|.. NotFound
EnrichmentVerdict <|.. VTransient
EnrichmentVerdict <|.. Failed
EnrichmentVerdict <|.. VUnknown
Found --> EnrichmentProfile
ReusePlan <|.. Hit
ReusePlan <|.. Join
ReusePlan <|.. Lead
ReusePlan <|.. OwnLeadership
ReusePlan ..> ReuseIndexEntry : lê
ReusePlan ..> Leadership : lê
Hit --> ReuseIndexEntry
ReuseIndexEntry --> EnrichmentResultType
Leadership --> EnrichmentResultType
EnrichmentResolved --> ReuseDecision
EnrichmentResolved --> EnrichmentResultType
EnrichmentResolved --> EnrichmentProfile

note right of ReusePlan
    Ordem: REUSE# válido e da política em vigor = Hit;
    sem INFLIGHT# = Lead(1, 1); INFLIGHT# do próprio workRef =
    OwnLeadership; COMPLETED ou lease vencida = Lead(v + 1);
    senão, Join(v).
end note
note bottom of EnrichmentVerdict
    Transient: 429, 5xx ou falha antes do envio (retry no worker).
    Failed: outros 4xx, 404 sem notFoundRefs (UNDECLARED_NOT_FOUND)
    ou 2xx ilegível. Unknown: sem resposta depois do envio.
end note

legend right
    <b>Leitura</b>
    <back:$COR_DOMINIO>    </back> Estado persistido (REUSE#, INFLIGHT#)
    <back:#F1F8E9>    </back> Valor imutável (record)
    <back:$COR_APLICACAO>    </back> Decisão pura, sem SDK
    <back:$COR_SAIDA>    </back> Evento publicado
endlegend
@enduml
